    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to bring to the market this attractive four-bedroom detached residence, set on a generous elevated site of approximately one acre in the scenic townland of Rathnawooraun, Killala.\n\nThe property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising a welcoming entrance hallway, a comfortable living room, a bright open-plan kitchen and dining area, a separate utility room and a convenient ground-floor WC. There are four generously sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a main family bathroom. The property also has an extensive attic that can be converted to provide extra space.\n\nExternally, the residence is approached by an asphalt driveway offering ample off-street parking. The property is surrounded by attractive natural stone boundary walls to the front. The extensive grounds provide excellent outdoor space for gardening, entertaining, family use or further landscaping.\n\nLocated in an area renowned for its natural scenic beauty and peaceful rural surroundings, the property enjoys a tranquil countryside setting while remaining conveniently positioned close to Palmerstown Bridge, Killala and Ballycastle. Situated just off the Wild Atlantic Way, it also offers easy access to the spectacular coastline, beaches, walking routes and many attractions of North Mayo.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious four-bedroom family home on a substantial site, combining privacy, countryside living and convenient access to nearby towns, villages and everyday amenities.\n\nCall today to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.33m x 5.70m\nAdditional 11.23m x 1.16m\n\nLiving Room - 4.36m x 3.49m\nOak floor, natural wood surround, cast iron insert\n\nKitchen Area - 3.53m x 7.96m\nTiled floor, solid wood kitchen. large stove and back boiler, natural stone surround fireplace.\n\nUtility Room - 1.81m x 2.38m\nBuilt-in presses, tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer.\n\nShower Room - 1.16m x 3.04m\nFully tiled. Mira eletric shower.\n\nBathroom - 3.00m x 2.4m\nCorner shower, electric pump, fully tiled.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.16m x 4.05m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.45m x 2.47m\nElectric shower, fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 3.63m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.4m x 3.82m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.58m x 4.48m"
